        "promptState": {
          "accent": null,
          "showExpanded": false,
          "text": "subject_definitions:\nNo external picture, video, or audio reference is supplied; every subject is created only from this description.\n\nsummary:\nA premium realistic action-trailer escape across rain-darkened rooftops at dusk, presented as one coherent five-second cinematic sequence.\n\nretention_analysis:\nNo external subject is retained. Keep the newly created protagonist's face, clothing, body proportions, and direction of travel internally consistent across the entire sequence.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] An athletic adult protagonist in practical dark clothing sprints across a wet rooftop in a post-rain metropolis at dusk while distant pursuers close in. Use restrained anamorphic photography, shallow depth of field, realistic film grain, volumetric city haze, and flying traffic between towers. Build from a low tracking medium shot into one decisive leap across a narrow rooftop gap, then settle into a stable landing composition. Motion remains physically plausible with correct limbs and hands, consistent identity and wardrobe, no teleporting or morphing, no internal montage, no readable signs, text, captions, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nFootfalls on wet concrete, fabric movement, controlled breathing, distant traffic, rain runoff, and a restrained landing impact with clean dynamics and no hiss or clipping.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nTense modern cinematic percussion and low strings rise toward the leap and resolve on the landing; no vocals.",
